<title>MEXICO: Mexico Televisa chief corporate officer quit.</title>
<headline>Mexico Televisa chief corporate officer quit.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's Grupo Televisa SA said on Monday that its chief corporate officer Guillermo Canedo White had resigned to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>&quot;I feel it is best for me to move on and pursue other interests,&quot; Canedo said in the Televisa statement received in Mexico City.</p>
</text>
